SET
  @DisplayName_23cb2b547bc6 = N'Billed To Date'
SET
  @Description_23cb2b547bc6 = N'Cumulative REVENUE of this line invoiced to the customer — its net, what Deferred Revenue or Sales was credited, NOT net plus tax and charges, which credit their own accounts and never touch Deferred. Advanced by each instalment invoice, and by confirm itself for a line with no payment schedule, inside the same transaction that books the entry (D92). Same basis as RecognizedToDate, or the gap between them overstates Deferred by the tax. With RecognizedToDate it gives the line''s balance-sheet position: the excess over RecognizedToDate sits in Deferred Revenue. Never derived at read time — the contra account a recognition entry debits depends on what has been billed by then, which is not knowable at confirm. Signed: negative on a reversal line (Quantity < 0), so an origin and its reversals net to zero.'
